        "content": {
            "raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Good design is as little design as possible. We strip away everything that does not serve the reader, and what remains is calm, legible and quick to load.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every layout here sits on an 8px grid. Spacing inside controls may use 4px steps; everything else moves in multiples of eight, which keeps rhythm consistent across pages.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Colors are never hard-coded. Each theme ships a small set of CSS variable tokens — background, foreground, primary, muted, border — and every component reads from them.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
